**Given:**

x = y = frac{{sqrt {6 - 1} }}{{sqrt {6 + 1} }}

**Concept used:**

Here we need not to put the complex value of x and y,

Only put x = y

**Calculation**

frac{{( {3{x²} + 5xy + 3{y²}} )}}{{( {3{x²} - 5xy + 3{y²}} )}}

⇒ frac{{( {3{x²} + 5{x²} + 3{x²}} )}}{{( {3{x²} - 5{x²} + 3{x²}} )}}

⇒ 11x²/x²

⇒ 11
